# Neurobagel fixtures are the data plane's documents byte for byte (some have CRLF or CR line
# endings, a byte order mark or trailing whitespace) and tests compare their sha256, so git must
# never normalize them. Goldens and recordings are generated and compared byte for byte too, and the
# upstream annotation files are Neurobagel's, kept unchanged, with the git blob SHA-1 of each recorded.
test/neurobagel/fixtures/** -text
test/neurobagel/upstream/** -text
test/neurobagel/golden/** -text linguist-generated
test/neurobagel/oracle/** linguist-generated
shared/neurobagel/vocab/** linguist-generated
scripts/neurobagel/*.py.lock linguist-generated
